data gcs_inter_region_replication_note: String = "Google Cloud Storage prices REPLICATION explicitly and separately: writing to a dual-region or multi-region bucket costs 0.02 USD per GiB replicated in North America and Europe (0.04 turbo; 0.08 in Asia). This is the one cited row in the set that puts a number on geographic replication as its own axis rather than folding it into the storage rate -- and it is charged per byte WRITTEN, not per byte stored, so it prices the ingest of new content, not the holding of it."

