data storj_distributed_note: String = "Storj is the erasure-coded distributed shape and the only vendor here whose pricing page states its redundancy posture in the same breath as its price ('Distributed globally across tens of thousands of storage locations'), which is why its redundancy scope is cited rather than unstated. It meters egress at the same 7 USD per TB as storage, so unlike the hyperscalers its network term never dominates by an order of magnitude, and unlike the zero-egress vendors it never vanishes."

