data azure_egress_tier_ladder_note: String = "Azure's retail API returns MORE THAN ONE Standard Data Transfer Out ladder for eastus (one anchored at tierMinimumUnits 100, matching the documented first-100-GB-free allowance, and another anchored at 10100/50100/150100 with different rates). These rows carry the 100-anchored ladder because its anchor matches the published free allowance; the existence of the second ladder is recorded here rather than silently discarded, and picking between them by execution needs a billed account, which this model does not have. Dissolve-on: a receipted Azure invoice line, or a Microsoft doc naming which ladder applies to blob egress."

